{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109093258048-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109100544\"/><p>天文台在今日(9日)上午6時10分發出強烈季候風信號，現時仍然生效，預料本港吹偏北強風，平均風速每小時超過四十公里。陣風間中達烈風程度。</p><p>在今日上午9時30分的過去一小時，橫瀾島、西貢及長洲分別錄得的最高持續風速為每小時60、56及50公里，最高陣風分別為每小時69、80及71公里。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.624328+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T01:32:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.463336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:45.130011+00:00","content_hash":"48147fd403fc7e2471b5759d7887a2949db35e8ebd690b30b625dfcf3d1241d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.624328+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}